message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HYDI System v2"
abstract: >
  HYDI System v2 (also known as "Heidi") is a monetizable AI orchestration
  platform that runs a deterministic six-layer event pipeline
  (Ingestion → RAW EVENT LEDGER → CASCADE → KILO → ProtoForge → Emission)
  over an immutable append-only ledger. It manages multi-revenue-stream
  billing via Stripe Connect, hosts a Next.js frontend on Vercel, offloads
  async work to 42 Supabase Edge Functions (Deno), and coordinates
  hardware/HID agents for physical device automation.
